  "body": "Enjoy easy coastal living at Saltwood, Red Beach, in this beautifully designed three-bedroom townhouse. With your own internal-access garage, quality finishes and a private courtyard, this is a rare opportunity to secure a modern home in a sought-after coastal location for $899K.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor is designed for effortless everyday living, with an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area filled with natural light and opening directly onto your own private courtyard. The designer kitchen features stone benchtops, quality appliances and generous storage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the master bedroom offers a private ensuite, while two additional bedrooms provide flexibility for family, guests or working from home. A well-appointed main bathroom and additional guest toilet add to the home's practical appeal.\r\n\r\nOutside, the courtyard creates a private spot to unwind or entertain, while the internal-access garage provides secure parking and extra convenience.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned close to Red Beach, parks, cafés, shops and schools, Saltwood offers the best of low-maintenance living with a relaxed coastal feel.\r\n\r\nThree bedrooms. Your own garage. A sought-after coastal location. Now just $899,000.\r\nOpportunities like this are few and far between.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n - Three bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\n - Internal-access garage\r\n - Designer kitchen with stone benchtops and quality appliances\r\n - Light-filled, open-plan living and dining\r\n - Private courtyard\r\n - Master bedroom with ensuite\r\n - Quality finishes and fixtures throughout\r\n - Window furnishings included\r\n\r\nClose to Red Beach, parks, cafés, shops and schools. Visit an open home or call to arrange a viewing.",
